<!-- Modal / Popup -->
<!--.modal-overlay — Poori screen ko cover karne wala dark transparent background (rgba(0,0,0,0.5)), 
position: fixed se scroll ke sath move nahi hota, default display: none (invisible), JavaScript ise 
flex karke dikhati hai jab popup khulna ho.
.modal-box — Andar ka safed card jisme actual popup content hota hai (icon, message, Yes/No buttons) 
rounded corners, shadow, aur fixed width ke saath center mein rehta hai.-->

<!--Save Modal (#confirmModal) aur Delete Modal (#deleteModal) dono same pattern follow karte hain:
• SVG icon (green checkmark ya red cross)
• Confirmation text
• Yes/No buttons
Dono alag alag IDs rakhte hain taake independently control ho sakein (ek dusre ko disturb na karein).-->
<div class="modal-overlay" id="confirmModal">
    <div class="modal-box">
